  "title": "Filipino Beef Giniling (Afritada Style)",
  "description": "Beef giniling is a savory mixture of ground beef, potatoes, vegetables, and raisins in a tomato-based sauce. It&#39;s Filipino comfort food at its best!",
  "authors": [
    "Pamela Leyva"
